Package: pldis
Title: Statistical Tools for Fitting Discrete Power-Law Models
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Nixon", "Jerez Lillo", , "njerezlillo@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8750-969"))
Description: This package provides a set of tools for fitting the discrete 
             power-law model using the ordinary maximum likelihood estimator
             or a Fisher-penalized maximum likelihood estimator (Firth-type
             bias reduction).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
